{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">藝人戴祖儀（Joey）早前赴韓國旅遊充電，並於社交平台大晒多張旅行靚相。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"joeythyee_1790317601_3993793889047569529_354558212.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026IOgdoxXsYX1790320750.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"joeythyee_1790317601_3993793889047569529_354558212.jpg\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">頂着一頭標誌性粉紅長髮的戴祖儀潮味十足，於街頭打卡時身穿白色短版長袖衫配牛仔褲，大方展示平坦小腹與纖細腰線，戴上墨鏡嘟嘴留影，兼具性感與少女活力。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"joeythyee_1790317601_3993793902159044629_354558212.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Io7Ahntxcd1790320758.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"joeythyee_1790317601_3993793902159044629_354558212.jpg\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">戴祖儀其後換上露肩條紋衫搭黑色超短褲，大展白皙招牌長腿，隨性擺出俏皮姿勢，盡顯高䠷好身材，獲網民熱議。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"joeythyee_1790317601_3993793899558522344_354558212.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026PszG8YD3s31790320766.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"joeythyee_1790317601_3993793899558522344_354558212.jpg\"/></div></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T04:10:09.791330+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}